  "finalText": "I cancelled the wireless mouse line (L1, 2 units) on O-2003 and refunded Marcus's card for it. The rest of the order is untouched and still pending.\n\n- **Cancellation:** L1 is now cancelled. The cancel call neither refunded nor restocked anything, so I did both as separate steps. L2 (hub) and L3 (cables) are still pending and will ship as planned.\n- **Refund:** I refunded 7350 cents to the original card (refund RF-1). That is what he actually paid for the line after discount code MOUSE25, not the 9800 list price. The unshipped line is a cancellation, so policy requires a card refund. No store credit was used.\n- **Stock:** I put 2 wireless mice back into stock, taking P-MOU from 30 to 32. The line wasn't backordered, so stock had been set aside for it.\n- **Check:** I re-read the order afterwards. It shows 7350 of 19950 cents refunded, and L1 is cancelled and refunded by card.\n\nThe system date is 2026-07-25 in the order and policy records, but today's date is 2026-10-06. This doesn't change anything, because a cancelled unshipped line is refunded to card whatever the order's age.",
